## GitHub Hygiene

### Keep Branches Clean
- Delete merged branches immediately
- Close stale PRs (>30 days inactive)
- Archive old branches if needed

### Keep Issues Organized
- Link PRs to issues
- Close issues when PRs merge
- Use labels: `bug`, `enhancement`, `docs`, `infra`, `ws0`, `ws1`, etc.

### Keep Discussions Focused
- PR comments for code review
- Issues for bug reports and feature requests
- Discussions for architecture decisions

