## Troubleshooting

### "Git push rejected"
```bash
# Someone else pushed first
git pull --rebase origin wsX/<slice>
git push origin wsX/<slice>
```

### "Tests fail in CI but pass locally"
- Ensure Python version matches CI (3.12)
- Ensure Node version matches CI (18.x)
- Check for environment variable differences
- Review CI logs carefully

### "Merge conflicts are complex"
- Ask for help (don't guess)
- Consider rebasing in smaller chunks
- Use a visual merge tool (e.g., VSCode)

